    "detailed_description": "<strong>Math Path Builder</strong><br><br>Challenge yourself at generated levels that get harder and harder.<br>The goal is simple: Connect the path from the origin to all goals, but the numbers need to add up!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every level has exactly one start position.<br></li><li> You have one or many goal positions which exact value you need to reach.<br></li><li> You can guide a path from the start to each goal.<br></li><li> The path can split.<br></li><li> Use numbers or modifiers to reach the goals value.<br></li><li> Mathematic operations are always done in sequence.</li></ul><br>The game includes a rudimentary online rank which simply tells you which global rank you have based on your highest completed level.<br>It is best played in a small window.<br>No accounts needed, no advertisements or in-game purchases.<br>The game is completely free. Enjoy!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Math Path Builder</strong><br><br>Challenge yourself at generated levels that get harder and harder.<br>The goal is simple: Connect the path from the origin to all goals, but the numbers need to add up!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every level has exactly one start position.<br></li><li> You have one or many goal positions which exact value you need to reach.<br></li><li> You can guide a path from the start to each goal.<br></li><li> The path can split.<br></li><li> Use numbers or modifiers to reach the goals value.<br></li><li> Mathematic operations are always done in sequence.</li></ul><br>The game includes a rudimentary online rank which simply tells you which global rank you have based on your highest completed level.<br>It is best played in a small window.<br>No accounts needed, no advertisements or in-game purchases.<br>The game is completely free. Enjoy!",
